Used a local profile pointer and branch-prediction hints so the common valid-profile/valid-index path stays straight-line and the null/out-of-range returns are treated as cold.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetNum(void) const
{
    const auto p = profile;
    if (__builtin_expect(p != NULL && profileIndex < p->numFields, 1))
        return p->fields[profileIndex].num;
    return FIT_FIELD_NUM_INVALID;
}
```